### Storage pool degraded
A storage pool on this node is degraded (status 5). It still serves I/O, but with reduced redundancy or performance.

#### Check first
1. [Node metrics](/#/components/{{ componentUrnForUrl }}/metrics) → **Portworx** tab → **Health**, and **Disk latency** under **Performance**.
2. `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl service pool show` and `kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl service drive show` on the node, and `dmesg` for disk errors.

#### Fix
Replace the failing drive (`kubectl -n <portworx-namespace> exec <px-cluster-pod> -c portworx -- /opt/pwx/bin/pxctl service drive replace`) and let the pool recover.
